            "text": "PR1-MUTANTS HARD-STOP CARRIED FORWARD, UNCHANGED and NOT RE-MEASURED against this head: the base_sha is unchanged (ef72c05809) and this 1-commit/2-file delta (a SIGPIPE/pipefail fix confined to scripts/check_release_assets.sh and scripts/release_criteria.sh) touches no application logic in the 3555-in-diff-mutant surface measured at d57f897 and carried at ba09f72a/7218961ef9. It remains an operator-declared, non-waivable HARD-STOP escalated to the operator, not a fix target on this branch, and the 60-mutant cap must not be raised. This finding alone continues to force the verdict to something other than a clean approve, regardless of every other finding on this delta being resolved or clean."
